32:["$","p","61",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Gone are the days of \"Customers also bought...\" based solely on aggregate popularity. Modern recommendation engines use collaborative filtering, real-time session data, and predictive LTV modeling to serve hyper-relevant suggestions -- *inside emails*."]}]
